concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-7-sec-4 cml:asserts concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-7-sec-4-logic-deontic-2 .
